      {
        "thread_id": "TH2",
        "thread_goal": "Validate technical feasibility and agree on infrastructure changes for the pilot.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M19",
            "speaker_id": 123347,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi team, I've completed the initial infrastructure assessment for T3. The summary is now available. Overall, our existing data sources are sufficient, but I've identified a potential performance bottleneck in the primary data pipeline during peak hours. This could affect dashboard loading times.",
            "mentions": [
              22473,
              94563
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T3"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M20",
            "speaker_id": 94563,
            "reply_to": "M19",
            "text": "Thanks for the detailed report. This is critical info. Regarding the bottleneck, can the current pipeline support the KPIs we've defined in the A8 spec, specifically the real-time user activity metric? A delay there would significantly reduce the product's value.",
            "mentions": [
              123347
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A8"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M21",
            "speaker_id": 123347,
            "reply_to": "M20",
            "text": "It can support them, but with a potential latency of up to 15 minutes during the peak window (9-11 AM). True real-time would require provisioning a dedicated stream processor, which is a significant change. We could also optimize the existing batch job to run more frequently, maybe every 5 minutes. That's a smaller change we could fit into the pilot timeline.",
            "mentions": [
              94563
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M22",
            "speaker_id": 22473,
            "reply_to": "M21",
            "text": "What does 'stream processor' mean?",
            "mentions": [
              123347
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M23",
            "speaker_id": 94563,
            "reply_to": "M22",
            "text": "It's a system for processing data continuously as it's generated, instead of in batches. For the pilot, a 5-minute refresh rate as @123347 suggested seems like a great compromise. It's a major improvement over 15 minutes and keeps the infrastructure changes manageable. I think we can accept that for the pilot.",
            "mentions": [
              123347,
              22473
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "thumbsup",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M24",
            "speaker_id": 123347,
            "reply_to": "M23",
            "text": "Okay, so the plan for T9 would be to implement the optimized 5-minute batch job. I can get that done in a few days. No other major infra changes are needed for the MVP scope.",
            "mentions": [
              94563
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T9"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M25",
            "speaker_id": 22473,
            "reply_to": "M24",
            "text": "So the data will be fine? That's good.",
            "mentions": [
              123347
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M26",
            "speaker_id": 94563,
            "reply_to": "M25",
            "text": "Yes, it sounds like we have a clear path. Let's formalize the decisions here:\n1. We agree that the current data pipelines, with optimizations, can support the defined KPIs for the pilot. The 5-minute refresh rate is acceptable. (D4)\n2. The only in-scope infrastructure change for the pilot will be the optimization of the batch job to reduce latency. A dedicated stream processor is out of scope. (D3)\n\n@123347 can you please document this in the T9 plan?",
            "mentions": [
              123347,
              22473
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T9"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D4",
              "D3"
            ],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "white_check_mark",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M27",
            "speaker_id": 123347,
            "reply_to": "M26",
            "text": "Will do. I'll update the T9 ticket with the specifics and timeline by EOD.",
            "mentions": [
              94563
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T9"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M28",
            "speaker_id": 22473,
            "reply_to": "M26",
            "text": "Sounds good.",
            "mentions": [
              94563
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M29",
            "speaker_id": 242297,
            "reply_to": "M26",
            "text": "Thanks for the clarity. This helps us set the right expectations with pilot customers about data freshness.",
            "mentions": [
              94563
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M30",
            "speaker_id": 132848,
            "reply_to": "M26",
            "text": "Good decision.",
            "mentions": [
              94563
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
