          {
            "msg_id": "M68",
            "speaker_id": 94563,
            "reply_to": "M67",
            "text": "Thanks for the update, @22473. That's a good starting point. I've been monitoring the A8 dashboard and consolidating the qualitative feedback from the pilot customers. The overall sentiment is positive, but there are two strong themes emerging:\n1. They love the core visibility but find the 5-minute data refresh a bit slow for their most urgent use cases.\n2. We've had three separate requests for some form of alerting feature.\nThis seems to validate our earlier hypothesis.",
            "mentions": [
              22473
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A8"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "chart_with_upwards_trend",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M69",
            "speaker_id": 242297,
            "reply_to": "M68",
            "text": "From the support side, we've seen the same. The onboarding process went smoothly, but most of the follow-up questions were about data freshness and notifications.",
            "mentions": [
              94563
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M70",
            "speaker_id": 123347,
            "reply_to": "M68",
            "text": "Interesting. The feedback on data refresh gives us a clear business case to revisit the streaming architecture we discussed earlier. It's a bigger piece of work, but the pilot data justifies it.",
            "mentions": [
              94563
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M71",
            "speaker_id": 22473,
            "reply_to": "M68",
            "text": "So should we stop the product?",
            "mentions": [
              94563
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M72",
            "speaker_id": 94563,
            "reply_to": "M71",
            "text": "Quite the opposite! This is very positive feedback. It shows we've solved a real problem and customers are engaged enough to ask for more. This isn't a signal to pause; it's a clear signal to iterate. The core value is validated. Based on this, I propose our next phase focuses on two main items for the T12 roadmap: \n1. Improve data infrastructure to near real-time.\n2. Introduce a basic alerting MVP.",
            "mentions": [
              22473
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T12"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "rocket",
                "count": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M73",
            "speaker_id": 132848,
            "reply_to": "M72",
            "text": "Adding features could let us charge more for the Pro tier.",
            "mentions": [
